    #      files), found by its subject.
    #  FV. specs/0033 "Planning rulings on P1", ruling 12: every mktemp call of
    #      a logged script is checked under TMPDIR with a control. This script
    #      has one, the mktemp -d of its working directory, which change FN
    #      already checks with its control; the generator asserts it is the
    #      only mktemp call and that it makes no plain file.
    #
    # CARRIED TO M5 part 2 P3 from P2's scan script (printed in
    # records/logs/m5p2-p2/scan.log; its changes FR to FV are above), generated
    # by <home>/.cache/emend-build/m5p2-p3/gen/scan.py, every replacement
    # asserted to occur its stated number of times. What differs:
    #  FW. The phase is Milestone 5 part 2 P3's (specs/0033-read-breadth-
    #      survey.md, "P3: external links, the catalogue, the probe, the size
    #      record"): the doc commit pattern "M5 part 2 P3: commit planning docs
    #      (the P2 rulings)" and the subjects "M5 part 2 P3: "; the base is P2's
    #      record commit, found as the doc commit's parent and checked by its
    #      subject ("M5 part 2 P2 record: "), with a control that refuses the
    #      base's own parent's subject, P2's phase commit's; the log directory
