    #      <home>/.cache/emend-build/m5p2-p3. SPEC_PIN's default is 84374018...,
    #      the spec's blob at P3's doc commit (the P2 rulings added). The
    #      commit-message rule's fixtures name M5 part 2 P3.
    #  FX. The records are P3's: four pairs, a .md and a .txt each, the three
    #      samples' records/m5p2-p3-kinds-, m5p2-p3-pivots- and
    #      m5p2-p3-extlinks-<date>-<short sha> and the open check's
